tokenization

word based: each word has a specific IDs, similar words have different IDs, not all words have IDs, you can limit word IDs
character based: split into characters, 256 characters + numbers, more complete, very large tokens
subword-based: middle man from word and character based, rare words = characters or subwords and common words = word, 

